{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"703","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Mishka and Game"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mishka is a little polar bear. As known, little bears loves spending their free time playing dice for chocolates. Once in a wonderful sunny morning, walking around blocks of ice, Mishka met her friend Chris, and they started playing the game."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Rules of the game are very simple: at first number of rounds "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" is defined. In every round each of the players throws a cubical dice with distinct numbers from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"6"},{"kind":"text","text":" written on its faces. Player, whose value after throwing the dice is greater, wins the round. In case if player dice values are equal, no one of them is a winner."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In average, player, who won most of the rounds, is the winner of the game. In case if two players won the same number of rounds, the result of the game is draw."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mishka is still very little and can't count wins and losses, so she asked you to watch their game and determine its result. Please help her!"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains single integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n ≤ 100"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of game rounds."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines contains rounds description. "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th of them contains pair of integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"mi"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ mi,  ci ≤ 6"},{"kind":"text","text":") — values on dice upper face after Mishka's and Chris' throws in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th round respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If Mishka is the winner of the game, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"Mishka\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (without quotes) in the only line."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If Chris is the winner of the game, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"Chris\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (without quotes) in the only line."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If the result of the game is draw, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"Friendship is magic!^^\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" (without quotes) in the only line."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n3 5\n2 1\n4 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Mishka"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n6 1\n1 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Friendship is magic!^^"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n1 5\n3 3\n2 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Chris"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample case Mishka loses the first round, but wins second and third rounds and thus she is the winner of the game."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample case Mishka wins the first round, Chris wins the second round, and the game ends with draw with score 1:1."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third sample case Chris wins the first round, but there is no winner of the next two rounds. The winner of the game is Chris."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"703A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/703/problem/A"}